# Backend endpoint for the ResearchGap AI assistant (Azure App Service in front
# of Azure AI Foundry / Azure OpenAI). Copy this file to .env, fill in the real
# URL once the backend is deployed. Without it, ChatPage shows an honest
# "not deployed yet" message instead of a real reply.
VITE_AGENT_API_URL=https://your-app-service.azurewebsites.net/api/chat

# InnoServe 資服競賽規定不得出現學校名稱／logo／指導教授姓名。
# 中大校務治理競賽的部署維持預設（不設定，或設 true）即可露出校名。
# 建置 InnoServe 用的版本時，改成 false：
# VITE_SHOW_SCHOOL_BRANDING=false
